    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/31bea5ca9fabd040607e09c1b5770909.poster.avif?t=1753468274\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/31bea5ca9fabd040607e09c1b5770909.webm?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/31bea5ca9fabd040607e09c1b5770909.mp4?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tie those sneakers and ready your camera, it\u2019s time to set off on a new photo adventure in TOEM 2! Set a few years after the original story, you head off on another relaxing adventure, spurred on by your awakened passion for discovering and photographing these mysterious \u201cevents\u201d known as TOEM\u2019s.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/d4f7aeedb2c16c213990c18c4ad2db54.poster.avif?t=1753468274\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/d4f7aeedb2c16c213990c18c4ad2db54.webm?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/d4f7aeedb2c16c213990c18c4ad2db54.mp4?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a more confident adventurer by jumping and climbing your way across the environment, allowing you to see the world from a whole new perspective. Make your way through new regions, lend a hand to new faces and create lasting friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/b870aca030b4c680aa97004fa320b5cf.poster.avif?t=1753468274\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/b870aca030b4c680aa97004fa320b5cf.webm?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/b870aca030b4c680aa97004fa320b5cf.mp4?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for? There are more TOEMs to discover!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/31bea5ca9fabd040607e09c1b5770909.poster.avif?t=1753468274\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/31bea5ca9fabd040607e09c1b5770909.webm?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/31bea5ca9fabd040607e09c1b5770909.mp4?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tie those sneakers and ready your camera, it\u2019s time to set off on a new photo adventure in TOEM 2! Set a few years after the original story, you head off on another relaxing adventure, spurred on by your awakened passion for discovering and photographing these mysterious \u201cevents\u201d known as TOEM\u2019s.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/d4f7aeedb2c16c213990c18c4ad2db54.poster.avif?t=1753468274\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/d4f7aeedb2c16c213990c18c4ad2db54.webm?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/d4f7aeedb2c16c213990c18c4ad2db54.mp4?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a more confident adventurer by jumping and climbing your way across the environment, allowing you to see the world from a whole new perspective. Make your way through new regions, lend a hand to new faces and create lasting friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/b870aca030b4c680aa97004fa320b5cf.poster.avif?t=1753468274\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/b870aca030b4c680aa97004fa320b5cf.webm?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900640/extras/b870aca030b4c680aa97004fa320b5cf.mp4?t=1753468274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for? There are more TOEMs to discover!</p>",
